84
00:07:31.369 --> 00:07:38.989
Consider this worked case: Before coding,
students must document the input format,

85
00:07:38.989 --> 00:07:45.975
output format, correctness proof using
invariants or induction, and derive the

86
00:07:45.975 --> 00:07:49.150
